after=`('primary_persona',)`. The `primary_persona` adapter
populates `host.orchestrator` + `host.scope_runtime` within
`before_orchestrator_start` phase; topo-sort honours `after=`
declarations per workspace-bootstrap's discovery contract.

Sidecar-absent short-circuit (per plan §10 D-build.M5.6 +
AC.OSS-M5.6): when `host.memory_sidecar_url is None` (the
`memory_system` adapter's `launch: False` config skipped the
sidecar, common for test/no-graphiti workspaces), the supervisor
is NOT constructed; `host.memory_supervisor = None`; no
shutdown hook registered. The `DegradationComponent` is still
constructed — the Claude-API detection path stays active. This
keeps test workspaces booting cleanly without false-positive
supervisor probes against an absent sidecar.

